' A container or a string handed to a number parameter of a builtin, or a
' number to an array parameter: the compiler refuses the call, the
' interpreter raises error 11 at the call. Before, a compiled program read
' the pointer as the count and died.
OPTION "EXPLICIT"
DIM w AS ARRAY = [10, 20, 30]
PRINT TAKE(w, 2)
PRINT DROP(w, 5)
PRINT INSERT$("ac", 1, "b")
